<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Banca Afirme buys Banco Obrero from gov't.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Banca Afirme buys Banco Obrero from gov't.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's privately held Banca Afirme said on Wednesday that it acquired the previously state-owned Banco Obrero.</p>
<p>Terms were not announced.</p>
<p>&quot;The federal government conducted the sale through Fobaproa (a government bank support fund) after the Finance Ministry and the National Bank Commission gave formal approval to Banca Afirme,&quot; Banca Afirme said in a news release.</p>
</text>
